        "DiscountDLC count": 0,
        "About the game": "TenTek is an atmospheric mystical game where you take on the role of a friendly yet mysterious ghost, drifting through a small town that at first glance seems quiet and reality, behind the cozy houses and welcoming facades lie countless secrets, intrigues, and forbidden stories waiting to be uncovered. Your main goal is to observe the lives of the townspeople, study their habits, relationships, and secrets, and gradually unravel the main mystery of this place.You are an invisible witness. No one can see or hear you, but you are able to penetrate the most hidden corners of other people's lives, collecting fragments of the past and present. In the game, you will uncover over 150 unique photographs and 80 rare videos , each adding a new element to the puzzle of the overall story.These discoveries will hint at dramatic events, secret connections between characters, and dark truths they desperately try to keep hidden.Each photo is a small clue, and each video is a revelation that may completely change your understanding of what is happening. But TenTek is not just about finding clues.Along the way, you will encounter challenging puzzles and tasks that test your attentiveness.By solving them, you will unlock new locations, discover hidden objects, and gain access to previously closed areas of the town.Clues are scattered all over the world, and only the most observant players will be able to find them all.",
